---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Yifan Cheng">
  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Applied machine learning, built for production systems.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      I am a machine learning engineer and data scientist with 6+ years of experience designing, implementing, and
      operating applied ML systems. My work sits at the intersection of machine learning, software engineering,
      platform reliability, and practical AI adoption.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Current Direction</h2>
    <p>
      My public technical work focuses on reusable infrastructure for enterprise AI agents: evaluation harnesses,
      traceability, observability, governance, and deployment patterns that help teams move from prototypes to reliable
      production systems.
    </p>
    <ul class="pill-list">
      <li>AI agent infrastructure</li>
      <li>Evaluation systems</li>
      <li>MLOps</li>
      <li>Observability</li>
      <li>Governed tool use</li>
      <li>Enterprise AI reliability</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>Why This Site Exists</h2>
    <p>
      This site is a public archive of my technical writing, open-source projects, talks, and field-facing work. It is
      designed to make reusable engineering contributions easier to find, cite, and build on.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
